{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 36,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.93421936035156,
        246.438720703125,
        85.31422424316406
      ],
      "text": "Cost–effectiveness analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        95.56519317626953,
        350.33856201171875,
        108.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "This section deals with the following additional question:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.55284118652344,
        465.8425598144531,
        134.64083862304688
      ],
      "text": "What are the comparative costs, affordability and cost–effectiveness of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        134.9528045654297,
        242.8309326171875,
        149.04080200195312
      ],
      "text": "implementation of LC-aNAATs?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.70782470703125,
        526.9368286132812,
        172.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "WHO commissioned a systematic review to identify, evaluate and summarise the evidence on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        175.20782470703125,
        474.3954772949219,
        188.3528289794922
      ],
      "text": "cost, affordability and cost-effectiveness of LC-aNAATs, among other technologies.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.21173095703125,
        526.9656372070312,
        212.3567352294922
      ],
      "text": "A total of 1534 studies were identified in the original search; after removing duplicates, 736",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        214.71173095703125,
        527.1298828125,
        227.8567352294922
      ],
      "text": "potentially relevant studies were screened. Of these, 107 were assigned for full-text review",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        230.21173095703125,
        527.0029296875,
        243.3567352294922
      ],
      "text": "and were evaluated against the inclusion and exclusion criteria, and 29 studies were included",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        245.71173095703125,
        526.9644165039062,
        258.85675048828125
      ],
      "text": "in the final systematic review. Of the 29 included studies, 22 (76%) assessed Xpert MTB/RIF,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        261.21173095703125,
        526.7389526367188,
        274.35675048828125
      ],
      "text": "six (21%) assessed Xpert Ultra, and one study (3%) evaluated Truenat tests (both Truenat",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        276.71173095703125,
        524.4291381835938,
        289.85675048828125
      ],
      "text": "MTB Plus and Truenat MTB-RIF Dx). Ten of the studies evaluating Xpert MTB/RIF were cost–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        292.21173095703125,
        526.9654541015625,
        305.35675048828125
      ],
      "text": "effectiveness analyses, and 12 were cost analyses. All the included Xpert Ultra studies and the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        307.71173095703125,
        357.37890625,
        320.85675048828125
      ],
      "text": "study evaluating Truenat were cost–effectiveness analyses.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        331.7156066894531,
        526.7874145507812,
        344.8606262207031
      ],
      "text": "The cost-effectiveness analysis on Xpert was considered because of similarity between two",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        347.2156066894531,
        295.77947998046875,
        360.3606262207031
      ],
      "text": "technologies and scarcity of the data on Ultra.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        371.2195129394531,
        526.9150390625,
        384.3645324707031
      ],
      "text": "The studies included in the review were diverse, were conducted across various settings and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        386.7195129394531,
        526.9591674804688,
        399.8645324707031
      ],
      "text": "covered all income levels. This broad spectrum of research provided a comprehensive view of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        402.2195129394531,
        526.9656372070312,
        415.3645324707031
      ],
      "text": "the economic evidence on LC-aNAATs, with a focus on adults. Only three cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        417.7195129394531,
        526.9636840820312,
        430.8645324707031
      ],
      "text": "analyses included children. There were various comparator tests, including smear and culture.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        433.2195129394531,
        526.963623046875,
        446.3645324707031
      ],
      "text": "Most of the studies included sputum specimens. Six of the 10 cost–effectiveness analyses on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        448.7195129394531,
        526.9249877929688,
        461.8645324707031
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF presented results in natural units (additional people with TB detected), and the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992297172546387,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        464.2195129394531,
        526.9920654296875,
        477.3645324707031
      ],
      "text": "other four presented utility outcomes (quality-adjusted life years and disability-adjusted life",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        479.7195129394531,
        143.730224609375,
        492.8645324707031
      ],
      "text": "years [DALYs]).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        503.7235107421875,
        526.9636840820312,
        516.8685302734375
      ],
      "text": "The findings from the cost–effectiveness analyses showed that Xpert MTB/RIF was generally",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        519.2235107421875,
        526.9656982421875,
        532.3685302734375
      ],
      "text": "cost effective across the included studies when compared with smear or culture, except for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        534.7235107421875,
        526.9481201171875,
        547.8685302734375
      ],
      "text": "one study from Thailand, where TB LAMP was the dominant strategy. In contrast, there was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        550.2235107421875,
        527.2894287109375,
        563.3685302734375
      ],
      "text": "more heterogeneity in the methodology used in the cost–effectiveness studies for Xpert Ultra,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997099876403809,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        565.7235107421875,
        526.9625244140625,
        578.8685302734375
      ],
      "text": "and the findings showed that, for the Xpert Ultra versus sputum smear microscopy (SSM), an",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        581.2235107421875,
        526.9679565429688,
        594.3685302734375
      ],
      "text": "incremental cost–effectiveness ratio (ICER) ranged from US$ 72.72 to US$ 160.23 per DALY",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        596.7235107421875,
        526.9645385742188,
        609.8685302734375
      ],
      "text": "averted. In the only study on Truenat, it was found to be cost effective for children in India",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        612.2235107421875,
        443.29876708984375,
        625.3685302734375
      ],
      "text": "compared with Xpert MTB/RIF, with an ICER of US$ 94.72 per DALY averted.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.2274169921875,
        527.0733642578125,
        649.3724365234375
      ],
      "text": "In general LC-aNAATs are likely to be cost effective across various settings when compared",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        651.7274169921875,
        178.06019592285156,
        664.8724365234375
      ],
      "text": "with SSM and culture.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.7314453125,
        503.456787109375,
        688.87646484375
      ],
      "text": "More details on the economic evaluation of LC-aNAATs are available in  Web Annex B.9.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "20 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}